---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us"
  description="Learn about siza.dev, our mission to empower software engineers with tutorials, workflows, and tools."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-8 md:py-12">
    <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-brand-50 text-tech-indigo border border-brand-200 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4 font-display">
      👤 Who We Are
    </span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight mb-6">
      Our Mission: Empowering Software Engineers
    </h1>
    
    <div class="prose max-w-none space-y-6 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-[16px] md:text-[17px]">
      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>siza.dev</strong>, a premier resource dedicated to demystifying modern software development, developer tools, AI workflows, and tech career strategies.
      </p>
      
      <p>
        We believe that practical, clear, and high-quality knowledge is key to accelerating a developer's career. With the rapid evolution of AI coding assistants like Claude/ChatGPT, modern Git workflows, API testing, and remote career paths, developers have more opportunities than ever—but navigating this landscape can be overwhelming. siza.dev was built to bridge this gap by providing straightforward, actionable guides.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Core Values</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Accuracy &amp; Integrity:</strong> We conduct thorough technical testing before publishing any tutorials or configuration snippets.</li>
        <li><strong>Simplification:</strong> We break down complex architectures, API integrations, and developer workflows into clean, step-by-step guides.</li>
        <li><strong>Developer First:</strong> We write objective, developer-centric guides and only recommend tools that we genuinely use and love.</li>
      </ul>

      <blockquote>
        Please note that siza.dev is strictly an educational platform. All code snippets, setup tutorials, and career guides are provided as-is without warranty of any kind.
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
